WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:12.664
Dan breaks the school rules.

2
00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:16.285
He sits on his desk.

3
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:25.181
"Dan, sit in your chair!" says the teacher.

4
00:00:25.182 --> 00:00:29.189
He sleeps in class.

5
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:35.854
"Wake up, Dan!" says the teacher.

6
00:00:35.855 --> 00:00:42.036
He turns off the lights.

7
00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:51.422
"Turn on the lights!" says the teacher.

8
00:00:51.423 --> 00:00:55.739
He talks to his friends.

9
00:00:55.740 --> 00:01:01.431
"Be quiet!" says the teacher.

10
00:01:01.432 --> 00:01:04.805
He opens the window.

11
00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:12.071
"Close the window!" says the teacher.

12
00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:18.298
He makes a mess.

13
00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:26.133
"Clean up!" says the teacher.

14
00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:31.131
Uh-oh. Dan is in trouble.

